    response: "I have created a high-fidelity interactive prototype for your luxury 3D fashion platform, featuring three distinct aesthetic directions you can seamlessly switch between. \n\n- **Option 1: Noir (Dark Luxury)** \n  A high-contrast, dramatic aesthetic featuring deep obsidian backgrounds, sharp white typography, and liquid metal 3D visualizations. This is ideal for avant-garde or exclusive premium collections.\n- **Option 2: Alabaster (Ethereal & Warm)** \n  A softer, organic aesthetic wrapped in warm beige and matte clay tones. With diffused lighting and softer typography, this direction leans into sustainable, elevated, or minimalist fashion.\n- **Option 3: Prismatic (Modern Pristine)** \n  A pristine, ultra-modern aesthetic utilizing holographic lighting and pure glass-like 3D materials against crisp, clinical silvers. This fits well with highly technical or futuristic luxury wear.\n\nThe prototype includes an immersive, floating 3D canvas (representing the customized form) running fluidly behind a clean, minimalist user interface. The typography pairs the elegant **Cormorant Garamond** with the structured **Jost** sans-serif to convey immediate luxury. You can use the toggles at the bottom right to experience these three visual directions in real-time."
    thinking: "**Crafting the Conclusion**\n\nThe build completed successfully, which is great news! I am moving on to crafting a concise and professional final response. The structure will revolve around the three design themes that I have implemented within the prototype.\n\n\n"
