  planner_response {
    response: "I have updated the Virtual Fitting process into an elegant, guided 3-step wizard that perfectly matches your luxury aesthetic, replacing the manual text entry entirely.\n\nHere is what I implemented:\n- **Guided Onboarding Flow:** Instead of typing, users now progress through a high-end, responsive selection wizard with three steps:\n  1. **Category:** Menswear, Womenswear, or Gender Neutral.\n  2. **Body Architecture:** A selection of detailed body forms (e.g., Slim, Athletic, Broad, Curvy, Round).\n  3. **Aesthetic/Occasion:** Contextual style preferences (e.g., Minimalist Chic, Luxury Streetwear, Avant-Garde).\n- **Automated AI Curation:** The wizard collects these exact choices and constructs a precise profile to hand off to the Gemini AI. The backend model continues to perform a live web search to find the highest-quality, currently available garments online matching these structured preferences, complete with direct purchase links.\n- **Fluid Micro-Interactions:** Added smooth enter-and-exit layout transitions (`AnimatePresence`) as users step through the wizard, with dynamic button hover states that seamlessly invert depending on which 3D aesthetic environment (Noir, Alabaster, or Prismatic) is currently active. \n\nYou can try the new step-by-step wardrobe curation by clicking **\"Begin Virtual Fitting\"** in the UI."
    modified_response: "I have updated the Virtual Fitting process into an elegant, guided 3-step wizard that perfectly matches your luxury aesthetic, replacing the manual text entry entirely.\n\nHere is what I implemented:\n- **Guided Onboarding Flow:** Instead of typing, users now progress through a high-end, responsive selection wizard with three steps:\n  1. **Category:** Menswear, Womenswear, or Gender Neutral.\n  2. **Body Architecture:** A selection of detailed body forms (e.g., Slim, Athletic, Broad, Curvy, Round).\n  3. **Aesthetic/Occasion:** Contextual style preferences (e.g., Minimalist Chic, Luxury Streetwear, Avant-Garde).\n- **Automated AI Curation:** The wizard collects these exact choices and constructs a precise profile to hand off to the Gemini AI. The backend model continues to perform a live web search to find the highest-quality, currently available garments online matching these structured preferences, complete with direct purchase links.\n- **Fluid Micro-Interactions:** Added smooth enter-and-exit layout transitions (`AnimatePresence`) as users step through the wizard, with dynamic button hover states that seamlessly invert depending on which 3D aesthetic environment (Noir, Alabaster, or Prismatic) is currently active. \n\nYou can try the new step-by-step wardrobe curation by clicking **\"Begin Virtual Fitting\"** in the UI."
