  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed a massive upgrade to the application to integrate your specific requests for Pakistani fashion, interactive menus, icons, and high-fidelity visuals.\n\nHere is what I implemented:\n\n- **Interactive UI & Top Bar:** The top bar navigation (`Collections`, `Body Profiles`, `Maisons`, and `Search`) is now fully wired up. Clicking them will smoothly transition the user directly into the core Virtual Fitting experience.\n- **Intuitive Iconography:** I have integrated elegant, minimalist `lucide-react` icons into the step-by-step wizard. Categories (Menswear, Womenswear), Body Architecture (Slim, Athletic, Broad, Curvy, Round), and Occasions all now feature visual cues that fit seamlessly into the luxury aesthetic.\n- **Pakistani Fashion Web-Search:** I updated the server\'s AI Stylist configuration to specifically target live stock and pricing from premium Pakistani clothing brands (such as Khaadi, Sapphire, Sana Safinaz, J., Maria B, and Elan). It will estimate the prices and provide direct links to acquire the garments.\n- **AI-Generated Outfit Visualization:** *Because we cannot legally or reliably scrape raw copyright images directly from live brand websites using text search alone, I built something even better.* I integrated the **Imagen 3 High-Fidelity Image Generation model** into the backend. Now, when the stylist finishes curating your wardrobe from these Pakistani brands, it takes the exact descriptions of those garments and dynamically renders a breathtaking, ultra-realistic high-fashion editorial photo visualizing how the complete outfit looks together. \n\nThe generated visualization appears beautifully alongside the itemized list, giving the user an immediate sense of the curated aesthetic before they click the direct purchase links. You can try it out now by progressing through the Virtual Fitting room!"
    thinking: "**Detailing the Solution**\n\nOkay, the plan is locked in! I\'m going to explain the solution clearly to the user. The primary focus is now outlining the features, especially how the top bar buttons are directly linked to open the fitting room. I\'m also ready to describe the intuitive Lucide icons that were added, giving a visual cue for each clothing category and body type.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed a massive upgrade to the application to integrate your specific requests for Pakistani fashion, interactive menus, icons, and high-fidelity visuals.\n\nHere is what I implemented:\n\n- **Interactive UI & Top Bar:** The top bar navigation (`Collections`, `Body Profiles`, `Maisons`, and `Search`) is now fully wired up. Clicking them will smoothly transition the user directly into the core Virtual Fitting experience.\n- **Intuitive Iconography:** I have integrated elegant, minimalist `lucide-react` icons into the step-by-step wizard. Categories (Menswear, Womenswear), Body Architecture (Slim, Athletic, Broad, Curvy, Round), and Occasions all now feature visual cues that fit seamlessly into the luxury aesthetic.\n- **Pakistani Fashion Web-Search:** I updated the server\'s AI Stylist configuration to specifically target live stock and pricing from premium Pakistani clothing brands (such as Khaadi, Sapphire, Sana Safinaz, J., Maria B, and Elan). It will estimate the prices and provide direct links to acquire the garments.\n- **AI-Generated Outfit Visualization:** *Because we cannot legally or reliably scrape raw copyright images directly from live brand websites using text search alone, I built something even better.* I integrated the **Imagen 3 High-Fidelity Image Generation model** into the backend. Now, when the stylist finishes curating your wardrobe from these Pakistani brands, it takes the exact descriptions of those garments and dynamically renders a breathtaking, ultra-realistic high-fashion editorial photo visualizing how the complete outfit looks together. \n\nThe generated visualization appears beautifully alongside the itemized list, giving the user an immediate sense of the curated aesthetic before they click the direct purchase links. You can try it out now by progressing through the Virtual Fitting room!"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 795444172
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
