1\",\n    \"imageUrl\": \"https://loremflickr.com/800/800/womens,jeans,denim?lock=15\",\n    \"description\": \"Relaxed-fit vintage wash mom jeans for an effortlessly cool look.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"w-formal-new-3\",\n    \"brand\": \"Modernist\",\n    \"name\": \"Silk Blouse\",\n    \"category\": [\"Womenswear\"],\n    \"bodyTypes\": [\"Slim / Slender\", \"Round / Full\"],\n    \"style\": [\"Elevated Formal\"],\n    \"priceEst\": \"PKR 7,500\",\n    \"buyUrl\": \"https://example.com/blouse1\",\n    \"imageUrl\": \"https://loremflickr.com/800/800/womens,silk,blouse?lock=16\",\n    \"description\": \"A delicate, lustrous silk blouse that pairs beautifully with trousers or skirts.\"\n  }\n];\n\n// Generate string to append\nconst toAppendStr = newClothes.map(c => JSON.stringify(c, null, 2)).join(\',\\n  \');\n\ncontent = content.replace(/\\n\\];\\s*$/, \',\\n  \' + toAppendStr + \'\\n];\\n\');\n\nfs.writeFileSync(clothesFile, content, \'utf-8\');\nconsole.log(\"Appended 16 new distinct clothing items!\");\nEOF\nnode append_clothes.cjs"
    shell_name: "bash"
  }
}
