  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented a fix for the image mapping irregularities. \n\nThe previous provider was having trouble serving specific visuals, which caused the fallback placeholders (like the panda) and generic images across genders. \n\n**The Fix:**\nI have dynamically re-assigned the imagery for the entire catalog using a dedicated image provider that strictly filters by both **gender** and **clothing type**. \n- Every women\'s garment explicitly requests a \"woman\" tag alongside the clothing type (e.g., \"woman, midi, skirt\").\n- Every men\'s garment explicitly requests a \"man\" tag alongside the clothing type (e.g., \"man, navy, suit\").\n- The Kurta Shalwar and other ethnic wear pieces have also been updated to fetch accurate, corresponding visuals.\n\nThis ensures you will no longer see women\'s models appearing in the men\'s section, and all items should load reliably and accurately. Please let me know if any other pieces need adjustment!"
    modified_response: "I have implemented a fix for the image mapping irregularities. \n\nThe previous provider was having trouble serving specific visuals, which caused the fallback placeholders (like the panda) and generic images across genders. \n\n**The Fix:**\nI have dynamically re-assigned the imagery for the entire catalog using a dedicated image provider that strictly filters by both **gender** and **clothing type**. \n- Every women\'s garment explicitly requests a \"woman\" tag alongside the clothing type (e.g., \"woman, midi, skirt\").\n- Every men\'s garment explicitly requests a \"man\" tag alongside the clothing type (e.g., \"man, navy, suit\").\n- The Kurta Shalwar and other ethnic wear pieces have also been updated to fetch accurate, corresponding visuals.\n\nThis ensures you will no longer see women\'s models appearing in the men\'s section, and all items should load reliably and accurately. Please let me know if any other pieces need adjustment!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
